  "description": "The Etymon suite: one schema definition as the source of truth for JSON codecs, validation, OpenAPI, TypeScript, configuration and database structure. This package has no code of its own; it references the parts of the suite that cost nothing but FSharp.Core. The adapters (Etymon.Api.Giraffe, Etymon.Api.AspNetCore) and the generator package (Etymon.Invariants.FsCheck) are deliberately left out, because each carries a dependency that would then be everyone's.",
